<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/maplibre-gl/4.7.1/maplibre-gl.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/boring-cities/style.css' | relative_url }}?v={{ site.time | date: '%s' }}">
<div class="bc in-blog tex2jax_ignore mathjax_ignore">
<div class="pills" id="city-pills" role="group" aria-label="Choose a city"></div>
<div class="headline" id="headline" aria-live="polite"></div>
<p class="fine" id="coverage"></p>
<div id="stackbar" class="stackbar" role="img"></div>
<div class="legend" id="legend"></div>

<section id="s-compare" hidden>
<h2>How <span class="cn">this city</span> compares</h2>
<div class="pills" id="cmp-pills" role="group" aria-label="Cities to compare"></div>
<p class="bnote" id="compare-note"></p>
<div id="heat"></div>
<h3>What one city has that another doesn't</h3>
<div class="filters" id="diff-controls"></div>
<div id="diff" class="diff"></div>
<div id="profile-wrap" hidden>
<h3>Everyday profile</h3>
<div class="table-wrap"><table id="profile"></table></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="s-categories">
<h2>What you can do in <span class="cn">this city</span>, by category</h2>
<p class="bnote">Share of each category's activities that can be done here. Click a bar to filter everything below.</p>
<div id="cat-chart"></div>
<div id="treemap"></div>
</section>

<section id="s-map">
<h2>Where it happens</h2>
<p class="bnote">Blue dots are researched venues for specific activities. Gray points are sports, park, arts, craft and learning venues in OpenStreetMap &mdash; the background hum of the city. Rings are 5 km and 15 km from <span id="centre-name">the centre</span>.</p>
<div class="map-controls" id="map-controls"></div>
<div id="map"></div>
</section>

<section id="s-grid">
<h2>What it costs, how far it is</h2>
<p class="bnote">Each dot is one doable activity. Hover a dot; click a cell to filter the table.</p>
<div id="grid"></div>
</section>

<section id="s-no" hidden>
<h2>What you genuinely can't do here</h2>
<p class="bnote">Honest accounting: these need terrain, climate, animals or a law that doesn't exist in the metro area.</p>
<div id="nolist" class="nolist"></div>
</section>

<section id="s-table">
<h2>The full list</h2>
<div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
<div class="table-wrap"><table id="table"></table></div>
<p class="bnote" id="table-count"></p>
</section>

<footer>
<h2>How this was made</h2>
<p id="method"></p>
<p><a href="{{ '/assets/boring-cities/activities.csv' | relative_url }}" download>Download the data (CSV, all cities)</a> &middot; <a href="{{ '/assets/boring-cities/data.json' | relative_url }}" download>JSON</a></p>
</footer>
<div id="tip" class="tip" hidden></div>
</div>
